= Beyond Markets and States: Polycentric Governance of Complex Economic Systems / 超越市场与国家：复杂经济系统的多中心治理

#html.p(id: "en-G001")[#text("Start with a shared resource: a fishery, forest, or irrigation system. How can users cooperate when each person's choices affect what remains available to others?")]

#zh(id: "G001")[#text("从一项共同使用的资源开始：渔场、森林，或者灌溉系统。当每个人的选择都影响别人还能使用多少资源时，使用者怎样合作？")]

#html.p(id: "en-G002")[#text("Ostrom studies institutions built around real resources and communities. Rules, monitoring, enforcement, and local conditions help explain why similar-looking arrangements can have different outcomes.")]

#zh(id: "G002")[#text("奥斯特罗姆研究围绕真实资源与社群建立的制度。规则、监督、执行与地方条件，有助于解释为什么看起来相似的安排会产生不同结果。")]

#html.p(id: "en-G003")[#text("Polycentric governance directs attention to multiple interacting centers of decision-making. The lecture invites comparison of institutional arrangements rather than reliance on one universal prescription.")]

#zh(id: "G003")[#text("多中心治理把注意力引向多个相互作用的决策中心。演讲邀请读者比较不同的制度安排，而不是依赖一种普遍适用的处方。")]

#html.p(id: "en-G004")[#text("Reading question: who makes the rules, who checks compliance, and how can the rules change? Shared ownership alone does not answer these questions.")]

#zh(id: "G004")[#text("阅读时可以追问：谁制定规则，谁检查遵守情况，规则又怎样修改？仅仅说资源归大家共同所有，并不能回答这些问题。")]
